### LISTA DE PACIENTES SEM FILTRO
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/paciente
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Accept: application/json

### LISTA DE PACIENTES COM FILTRO DE NOME
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/paciente?nome=maria
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Accept: application/json

### LISTA DE PACIENTES COM FILTRO DE CPF
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/paciente?cpf=52998224725
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Accept: application/json

### LISTA DE PACIENTES COM FILTRO DE SEXO
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/paciente?sexo=FEMININO
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Accept: application/json

### LISTA DE PACIENTES COM PAGINAÇÃO E ORDENAÇÃO
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/paciente?page=0&size=10&sort=nome,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Accept: application/json